What I Learned
AI Works Better with Structured Data

Providing a CSV dataset allowed Claude to perform deeper analysis than a normal conversation.

Dashboards Tell Stories

Charts and KPIs are valuable because they turn raw numbers into understandable insights.

AI Can Act as a Data Analyst

Instead of only generating text, AI can:

Analyze datasets
Discover trends
Generate reports
Build dashboards
Support decision-making
Biggest Insight

The value isn't in the data.

The value is in understanding what the data is trying to tell you.

